# Conditioning execution

Use `runner.ts` for interval, sprint, and circuit playback. Preparation is five seconds and is not part of workout time. Derive remaining time from deadlines. Pause must not restart preparation.

Reconcile expired timer phases when the app returns to the foreground. Stop at a manual or GPS work phase. After process death, restore the last saved state and do not invent the missed work. Do not replay a backlog of cues.

`expo-background-task` is not a per-second timer. Keep-awake only applies while the timer is on screen. GPS uses the task in `conditioningLocationTask.ts`, which must stay imported from `index.ts`. Filtering defaults live in `gps-v0.1` and are not accuracy guarantees. Do not count paused movement or distance across a gap. Manual completion must not store the prescribed distance as measured distance.
